// PARKED — see ../README.md, "What is parked, and why".
//
// Zoo edge: TSO -> ARMv8 (strictly_weaker, provenance: litmus). The naive
// model-level query, with no mapping between the two instruction sets: it is
// refuted on `[DEP] data`, because ARM's dependency and ISB/DMB.ST vocabulary
// has no TSO counterpart. Settling the edge needs `assume`s encoding the
// mapping, as the compilation queries do.
include "../../kat/tso.kat"
include "../../kat/arm8.kat"

assert arm8::ob <= tso::tso+
